ReceiverDomainReplay
  ├── when an honest signed epoch-withdraw report is delivered to its intended Child
  │   └── it should succeed
  ├── when the identical signed report is redirected to a later activated Child
      ├── it should fail with no successful transmission
      ├── it should not reduce the destination strategy TVL
      ├── it should not create recovery state
      └── it should not spend attacker tokens
  └── when an honest signed rebalance report is redirected to its activated destination Child
      ├── it should fail with no successful transmission
      ├── it should not withdraw the destination's active strategy
      ├── it should not create recovery state
      └── it should not spend attacker tokens
